/private/var/folders/80/jm5p82hn56g0crpvv9xjzrc00000gn/T/jc2-lane.l8KjQg/inputs/d1-subtree-review-grok46-20260902.md:218:CH DISCLOSURE (1) stands: these are polynomial automorphisms (`s=1`, `M_s=n-1`), outside Def 5.1(3). They test JAC-FIBRE, FRONTIER-EXACT, the intrinsic `delta_1`, the coincidence, and D1-STAR. They do not test the numerical `delta_i` of a `s>=3` tower; that is the census / Moh rows.
