+## 4. Controls
+
+**[PROVED-HERE/UNREVIEWED]** The required positive control passes. For
+\((f,g)=(y,x+y^k)\), take at the bottom
+
+\[
+ P_1(\pi)=1+\pi^k,qquad Q_1(\pi)=\pi.
