+2. **[PROVED-HERE/UNREVIEWED]** Lines 112–154 compute
+   \(q=(1-\delta_1)de/(d+e)\) with `Fraction` and implement the current `(UNI)`
+   filter. If \(q=p/r\) is reduced, integrality of \(kV_2q\) is equivalent to
