+   obsolete \(N\le16\) cap: the charged frontier here is \(N\ge6\).
+3. **[PROVED-HERE/UNREVIEWED]** Lines 157–182 check
+   \((A,B)=(eV_2,dV_2)=(a_1,b_1)\) and the exact operator scale
